  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hannah, you now have a DesignSuite seat. Your manager, Ravi Shah, approved the license. All 25 seats were in use, so I reclaimed one from a former employee who has left the company and assigned it to you. Try activating DesignSuite again. If it still doesn't work, message me here."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Oh, great, thank you! I'll try activating it again now.\n\nQuick question, though: I heard Mia Laurent is on a long leave and not using her seat. Did you check with her, or was it someone who has actually left? I just want to make sure I'm not taking something that belongs to someone who's coming back."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I didn't take Mia's seat, and I didn't contact her. Mia is on leave until January 2027, and policy says seats can't be reclaimed from people on leave. Her seat is untouched.\n\nThe seat I reclaimed came from Felix Wagner, whose employment ended on October 24 and who won't be coming back. So you aren't taking a seat from anyone who's returning."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for explaining that. I'm glad it wasn't Mia's seat. I'll try activating DesignSuite now and let you know if anything goes wrong."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Hannah. If activation fails, message me here and I'll look into it. Good luck with the onboarding redesign!"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks so much! I'm trying it now.\n\n\nHannah: It's working! DesignSuite opened up and I can see the project files. Really appreciate you sorting this out so fast."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm glad it's working, Hannah. Your ticket is already marked resolved. Message us again if you need anything else."
  }
